{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This fun and competitive racing game challenges players to smoothly slide down mountains, using momentum and skill to achieve the fastest descent. Play as a variety of quirky bird characters and race against friends to beat the clock - times are always recorded, driving you to improve and set new records. Distinct themed worlds, such as Mushroom, Grass, and Ice, add visual variety and depth, making every run feel fresh and engaging. Perfect for those who love friendly rivalry and mastering tricky slopes together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More Features will be added soon.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4078820?t=1760556163","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4078820?t=1760556163","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078820/3464af4e07087a58a330d91a04398adf48efdc10/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760556163","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078820/3464af4e07087a58a330d91a04398adf48efdc10/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760556163","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This fun and competitive racing game challenges players to smoothly slide down mountains, using momentum and skill to achieve the fastest descent. Play as a variety of quirky bird characters and race against friends to beat the clock - times are always recorded, driving you to improve and set new records. Distinct themed worlds, such as Mushroom, Grass, and Ice, add vis